WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
- Speaking of birthdays, is it true

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.480
that you performed at
birthday parties as a clown

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.313
when you were a kid?

00:00:04.313 --> 00:00:05.146
- Oh yes.

00:00:05.146 --> 00:00:05.979
- I love this.

00:00:05.979 --> 00:00:07.500
And actually, I can see that happening.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.333
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:10.170
- [Eric] I mean, I have
been a clown, I think

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:11.003
oh there I am.

00:00:11.003 --> 00:00:12.210
- [Kelly] This is awesome.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:14.550
- So once, I mean, it's a
line in one of the episodes

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:15.383
of Modern Family.

00:00:15.383 --> 00:00:18.450
Once I found out that clowns

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.430
were just regular people with makeup,

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:23.130
I was like, well, that's
what I wanna do with my life.

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:26.490
And so my grandma started
making me clown costumes

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:30.870
and I started putting on my mom's makeup.

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:32.700
- She loved that.
- This is where I always say

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.880
I'm so thankful for the
great parents that I had,

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:39.660
that my dad, being a Kansas
man and me a Kansas boy,

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:44.010
here I am, playing football, raising pigs,

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.690
taking karate, playing the drums,

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:48.420
and putting on my mom's makeup
and wanting to put on a wig

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:51.150
and he was just like, "Go for it!"

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.150
You know?
- Love it.

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:53.553
That's a real dad.

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:55.680
- 100% led me to right here.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:56.513
- Yeah.

00:00:56.513 --> 00:00:57.346
I love that though.

00:00:57.346 --> 00:00:59.790
I think clowns is something
you love to make people laugh,

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:00.840
you love to make people feel good.

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:01.920
- Just wanna bring joy to people's lives.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:03.180
- Exactly.

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:05.220
You're making a joke
but you truly love that.

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:06.053
- 100%.

00:01:06.053 --> 00:01:08.550
That's what I tell Lindsey all the time.

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:09.661
- When she yells at me.

00:01:09.661 --> 00:01:10.494
- I'm just bringing joy.

00:01:10.494 --> 00:01:11.580
- You're 50!

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:13.280
Take the corn nuts somewhere else.

